{% extends "base.j2" %}

{% block content %}

    <h1>Welcome to the JUST example site!</h1>

    <p>JUST is a tech stack and static website generator, combining many languages and engines already used in other large projects:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>J</strong>inja - used for creating and templating webpages;</li>
        <li><strong>U</strong>mark - a simple, yet powerful markup language;</li>
        <li><strong>S</strong>ASS - a styling language which supports variables and includes.</li>
        <li><strong>T</strong>cl - a powerful scripting language used for compiling assets.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>It also supports languages which compile to JavaScript, such as CoffeeScript.</p>
    <p>Also - you can easily customize the build system (i.e. which extentions get compiled and how) by editing the <code>compile.tcl</code> file.</p>

    <h2>Exhibit I: Loading data from YAML</h2>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Title</th>
            <th>Year</th>
            <th>Score</th>
        </tr>
        
        {% for movie in load("test.yaml") %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{movie.title}}</td>
                <td>{{movie.year}}</td>
                <td>{{movie.score}}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}

    </table>

{% endblock %}